        "original_id": "bd47158e-c4a8-54b3-ad27-b3568ee1d3bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: VIVmag, La Belle Assemblée\n- People: David Harrison Gilmour, John Bell\n- Companies: FIJI Water LLC, Zinio Systems, Inc.\n- Topics: Magazine launches, publication history\n\nFacts:\n- La Belle Assemblée was a British women's magazine published from 1806 to 1837.\n- John Bell founded La Belle Assemblée, whose full title was \"La Belle Assemblée or, Bell's Court and Fashionable Magazine Addressed Particularly to the Ladies.\"\n- VIVmag was launched in 2006 as a bimonthly magazine.\n- David Harrison Gilmour backed VIVmag, and he was the founder of FIJI Water LLC.\n- The first issue of VIVmag appeared in January-February 2007.\n- Zinio Systems, Inc. distributed VIVmag.",
